{"sourceUrl":"https://adm.jlu.edu.cn/info/1109/30307.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.115894+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://adm.jlu.edu.cn/info/1109/30307.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>吉林大学行政学院是国内政治学和公共管理学教学科研重镇之一。</span><span><span>吉林大学行政学院的前身政治学系创建于</span><span>1983年，是我国高等院校在恢复政治学学科后建立的第一个政治学系，创始人是我国著名政治学家、吉林大学首批哲学社会科学资深教授王惠岩先生、原中国政治学会副会长杜若君先生、朱日耀先生。1993年12月，经原国家教委批准，在政治学系的基础上成立行政学院。现任院长为国家级领军人才马雪松教授。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>建院</span><span>40多年来，行政学院秉持“厚重包容、守正创新”的学术传统，致力于为当代中国政治学与公共管理学的繁荣发展和国家治理现代化贡献力量，学科建设、人才培养、队伍建设、学术研究、对外合作交流、服务社会等各项事业取得长足发展，成绩斐然。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、</span><span>学术活动开放日的目的及内容</span></p>\n<p><span>行政学院</span><span>“</span><span><span>学术活动开放日</span><span>”</span></span><span>，旨在为各高校优秀大学生提供学术交流平台，增进青年学生对</span><span>政治学</span><span>和</span><span><span>公共管理学</span> </span><span>的学习和研究兴趣。本次</span><span>学术活动开放日</span><span>将线下开展，</span><span>活动内容拟包括</span><span>专家讲座、</span><span>参观调研、交流研讨</span><span>等。</span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><span>日程安排</span></p>\n<p><span>7月1日：学生报到</span></p>\n<p><span>7月2日：开幕式、学院及专业介绍、专家讲座、参观调研</span></p>\n<p><span>7月3日：交流研讨、闭幕式</span></p>\n<p><span>二、招募计划</span></p>\n<p><span>可</span><span>根据个人研究方向及研究兴趣</span><span>申报如下专业：</span><span>030201</span><span>政治学理论、</span><span>0302J2</span><span>法律政治学、</span><span>0302Z1</span><span>廉政学、</span><span>030206</span><span>国际政治、</span><span>030207</span><span>国际关系、</span><span>120401</span><span>行政管理、</span><span>1204Z3</span><span>应急管理、</span><span>1204Z1</span><span>公共治理与公共政策等。具体入</span><span>选</span><span>人数将</span><span>根据</span><span>报名情况而定。</span></p>\n<p><span>三、申请资格</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，学风端正，身心健康，在校期间无违纪违法行为和违反学术道德行为；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>申请人应为全国各高等院校</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>届全日制应届本科毕业生（人文社科专业优先，鼓励跨专业申请）；</span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>大学本科期间学习成绩优异，本科前五学期专业或年级排名原则上应居前</span><span>25%</span><span>（所在学校或院系优秀生源集中或者申请学生在其它方面有突出表现可适当放宽该项要求）；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span>对政治学、公共管理学具有浓厚的兴趣，有较强的学术研究能力。</span></p>\n<p><span>四、</span><span>报名</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）申请报名</span></p>\n<p><span>即日起至</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>2</span><span>5</span><span>日下午</span><span>16:00</span><span>前</span><span>，申请人</span><span>将以下材料发送至指定邮箱（</span><strong><span>申请材料中</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>—</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span>项为必须提交项，</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong><strong><span>—</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>项为自愿选择提交项。</span></strong><span>）：</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>《吉林大学</span><span>行政学院</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>学术活动开放日</span><span>报名表》；</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>本科阶段成绩单和成绩排名证明各</span><span>1</span><span>份（需加盖学校教务处公章，原件扫描件</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式版本，须合并成</span><span>1</span><span>个</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式文件）；</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>国家英语四、六级考试成绩，或</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩，或</span><span>GRE/GMAT</span><span>成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明各</span><span>1</span><span>份（原件扫描件</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式版本，须合并成</span><span>1</span><span>个</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式文件）；</span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span>.</span><span><span>围绕</span><span>“中国式现代化与国家治理”</span></span><span>主题</span><span>，结合各申报专业的专业领域，提交研修报告</span><span>1</span><span>份（详细要求见附件</span><span>2</span><span>，</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式版本）；</span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span>.</span><span>各项获奖证书</span><span>1</span><span>份，并加盖院系公章（原件扫描件</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式版本，须合并成</span><span>1</span><span>个</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式文件）；</span></p>\n<p><span>6</span><span>.</span><span>体现个人学术水平的学术论文或研究成果</span><span>1</span><span>份（原件或复印件扫描件</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式版本）。</span></p>\n<p><span>按照以上申请材料各项要求及顺序提交电子版材料</span><span>，</span><span>以压缩包形式发到邮箱：</span></p>\n<p><span>xzyz203@jlu.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮件命名为</span><span>“</span></span><span>202</span><span>6年开放日</span><span>-</span><span>所在学校</span><span>-</span><span>所学专业</span><span>-</span><span><span>姓名</span><span>”。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>二</span><span>）确定</span><span>入选学员名单</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>学院组织评审小组审核材料，确定</span><span>入选学员</span><span>名单。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>27</span><span>日前，在学院网站公布审核结果，同时会以电子邮件、电话</span><span>、</span><span>短信等形式通知申请者本人，</span><span>未入选</span><span>同学不另行通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>结果公布</span><span>3</span><span>日内候选人需回复邮件进行确认，逾期未回复邮件者视为放弃资格，缺额将从候补名单中依次</span><span>递</span><span>补。</span></p>\n<p><span>六、注意事项</span></p>\n<p><span>学生</span><span>在</span><span>开放日</span><span>期间必须遵守吉林大学有关规章制度和</span><span>开放日</span><span>的要求、纪律和安排，按时参加活动。校园学术活动开放日活动期间，我院为所有学生购买人身意外伤害保险</span><span>。</span><span>住宿</span><span>费用由吉林大学行政学院承担，</span><span>餐费及</span><span>往返交通费用需自理。未尽事宜另行通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>七、咨询方式</span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：</span><span>宋老师</span></p>\n<p><span>联系电话：</span><span>0431-89228991</span><span>（工作日</span><span>8</span><span>：</span><span>30-11</span><span>：</span><span>30</span><span>、</span><span>13</span><span>：</span><span>30-16</span><span>：</span><span>30</span><span>）</span></p>\n<p><span>咨询邮箱：</span><span>songjh22@jlu.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>附件：</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>吉林大学行政学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>学术活动开放日</span><span>报名表</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>吉林大学行政学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>学术活动开放日</span><span>研修报告要求</span></p>\n<p><span>吉林大学行政学院</span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"5564caa75d05dda6166e0aa1047728f5a6701f75d75ed9b2ee4b24931d2f6b1e","textLength":1718,"sourceSha256":"b79bf8c5734e31fa55bd840c0814446b4d2b50ee22ae3023a2a227374af6473e","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件一：吉林大学行政学院2026年学术活动开放日报名表.docx","url":"https://adm.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1680101460&wbfileid=18146068"},{"name":"附件二：吉林大学行政学院2026年学术活动开放日研修报告要求.docx","url":"https://adm.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1680101460&wbfileid=18146067"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-108f6c55762d494cd2dc","title":"2026年吉林大学行政学院“学术活动开放日”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.115894+00:00"}
